OL,3,GNEWSAWales to fall silent with
OL,4,ARemembrance services across the country
OL,5,
OL,6,FA national Remembrance service will
OL,7,Ftake place in Cardiff to commemorate
OL,8,Fthose who have lost their lives in
OL,9,Fconflict, with communities across Wales
OL,10,Falso paying tribute.
OL,12,FMilitary formations will assemble at
OL,13,Fthe Welsh National War Memorial in
OL,14,FAlexandra Gardens, Cathays Park on
OL,15,FSunday, where wreaths will be laid.
OL,17,FOther commemorations are being held in
OL,18,FGwynedd, Wrexham, Powys and Swansea,
OL,19,Famong others.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
