OL,3,GNEWSAWales to fall silent with
OL,4,ARemembrance services across the country
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing Remembrance Sunday services
OL,7,Faround the UK, there will be further
OL,8,Fevents on Armistice Day, 11 November,
OL,9,Fwhen the traditional two-minute silence
OL,10,Fwill be observed at 11:00 GMT.
